//! `scripts/port/lua2rs config --range 1-1188` (unit T1) and spliced into the frozen stubs;
//! `mapAffixDropDownFunction` (117-130) and `enemySizePreset` (787-801) are hand-ported.
//!
//! `val` stays the dynamic `&Val` (calc doc §5.1): `val == "X"` does not coerce, arithmetic
//! and `math.min/max` coerce numeric strings (`Val::num`), `<`/`>` on a non-number raises,
//! and a mod value stores whatever `val` holds (`val_value`).
